AqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Z0GBtnKBhrpQFdv0luGr8g","review_id":"JMmN21WemaLEBiIIoUCucA","date":"2016-03-06T01:22:45","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9437587261199951,"text_excerpt":"BLUF: Great crepes; both savory and sweet. In St. Roch market I love foods where it is several things all in one. We got the bbq/mac&cheese crepe. It was really awesome. bbq sauce added an awesome kick and the pulled pork and mac and cheese were great. Great size too for the price. We walked around the market looking for a dessert and just ended back with Dirty Dishes. We got the strawberry cheesecake one. It was awesome. Big fan. very satisfying."},{"business_id":"Z0GBtnKBhrpQFdv0luGr8g","review_id":"CGeAMvSOixta4LhNrB_O_g","date":"2016-05-30T21:03:21","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9339468479156494,"text_excerpt":"Yet another one of the delicious gems located inside St. Roch Market. I stopped in for lunch and I already knew what I was getting. I had seen pictures of The Munch on the internets and I knew that I had to make this pulled pork and mac and cheese sandwich mine. My hopes were pretty high, but they were definitely met as soon as I was presented with this plate of goodness. The combination of pulled pork and mac and cheese sounds decadent, because it is. I only ate half of the sandwich and took the rest to go, I swear! My friend got a crepe, which looked fantastic and I will be trying one of those next time. I like that Dirty Dishes has a nice selection of different things that are sure to ..."},{"business_id":"Z0GBtnKBhrpQFdv0luGr8g","review_id":"uXNtAofgtLJA9Hqlm7X-qg","date":"2015-12-02T07:13:40","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9083564281463623,"text_excerpt":"Great place to eat whenever you are in the St Roch neighborhood. Favorable selection of food but you will not regret this diamond in the ruff. Try the Dirty Mac and The Munch...oh and there's this fleet de lis waffle (limited time) during mardi grad that is delicious! Remember, support local! Great Job Lesley, Artis and family. =)"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Z0GBtnKBhrpQFdv0luGr8g","photo_id":"UsuCnQqVHP5vHMSqRKRVoA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/UsuCnQqVHP5vHMSqRKRVoA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9389290809631348},{"business_id":"Z0GBtnKBhrpQFdv0luGr8g","photo_id":"qUQa-dthWrwzN18PSKS9VQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/qUQa-dthWrwzN18PSKS9VQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8105310201644897},{"business_id":"Z0GBtnKBhrpQFdv0luGr8g","photo_id":"wolrl9_O5Epy_Qqm-NiMfw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/wolrl9_O5Epy_Qqm-NiMfw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7894474267959595}]},"notebook_case":null}
